  "source_question": "The source prepares the full Cy/OEt phosphonate–borane2a and its dealkylated lithium salt and compares local B–O/P–O structure with small neutral/anion models. The selected task concerns what accounts for the local structural change.",
  "task_question": "What molecular account of the local B/O/P structural differences between phosphonate–borane2a and its dealkylated lithium salt is supported by the crystallographic observations and a defensible model investigation? Determine what can be attributed within the studied models and where experimental environment or model representation limits the conclusion.",
